 "remarks": "Stamford Living at Its Finest: 2-Bedroom Corner Unit at 444 Bedford Street Welcome to this bright 9th-floor corner unit at Bedford Towers, available for immediate occupancy. The spacious living and dining area opens to a private balcony with terrific views of vibrant downtown Stamford, a great spot for morning coffee or unwinding after a long day.  The Apartment - Two generous bedrooms - Updated throughout, with stainless steel appliances and a gas stove - Open living and dining area with plenty of room to entertain - Private balcony with downtown views - Water and sewer are included in the rent  Building Amenities - Spacious lobby with secure entry - On-site superintendent - Laundry facilities on the main level - Private storage locker included - Recreation room - Year-round building maintenance  Parking Street parking is available, and a parking garage sits right next to the building. Additional parking options are nearby as well.  Location Everything you need is close by: restaurants, the library, the Stamford train station, I-95, the hospital, and local shopping. Commuting and running errands are simple, whether you're heading into the city or staying in town.  Don't miss this great opportunity to live in the heart of Stamford. Schedule your showing today!",
